{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:46:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115002208668573753"],"id":"2115002208668573753","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":2314,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115000078104691168","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"目前排名前五的插件好像是这几个，直接跟 DeepSeek 说就行，确实都挺有用的：\n\ndsh-market、DSH-better-sidebar、DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget、dsh-context、dsh-pet","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115002208668573753"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114999848919568384"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115000038145589427","2115000078104691168"],"id":"2115000078104691168","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":12593,"like_count":80,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":6},"text":"装了几个热门的 DeepSeek Harness 插件，感觉这生态现在他妈的蓬勃发展\n\n主要是 DeepSeek 太便宜，能力又中不溜的很强。\n\n现在很多人就只用 DeepSeek Harness 了，尤其是爱折腾的年轻人，感觉跟以前刷机、搞搞 ROM 的是一类人 https://t.co/acM039bbwe","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115000078104691168"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114927881864499200"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T03:51:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114928011569213603"],"id":"2114928011569213603","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":87,"impression_count":15000,"like_count":60,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":60,"retweet_count":3},"text":"优化了一下我的个人 Memory 和多 Agent 的协作体系\n\n目前是 Codex、Muse 和 Grokbot 一起协作，每个有各自的职能，Claude 没敢让他加入 https://t.co/PNjFSswT82","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114928011569213603"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114733870327443456"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T15:00:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114733881312293241"],"id":"2114733881312293241","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7698,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113639194484670628","type":"quoted"}],"text":"豆包也已经完成了对 iPhone Duo 的适配 https://t.co/qmYFaiExXf https://t.co/vVCVY4eODI","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114733881312293241"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T13:52:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114716867327918392"],"id":"2114716867327918392","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":11509,"like_count":15,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又到了我的 AIGC Weekly 很多朋友续费的时间。今年因为 Quaily 有点问题，所以先推荐大家从小报童买了\n\n我也弄了一些 75 折的优惠券，有续费需求的话可以领一下。\n\n快到期的或者没到期的都可以领，反正时间是叠加的嘛。\n\n小报童的返利我也依然开着，如果有推荐给朋友买的可以试试，还能挣点小钱：","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114716867327918392"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114716234914865152"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T13:50:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114716247531417771"],"id":"2114716247531417771","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":8371,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114705042817110293","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Anthropic 已经正式提交了纳斯达克上市的 S-1 文件，股票代码是 ANT，承销商是高盛和摩根士丹利。\n\n目前注册声明还没有被 SEC 宣布生效。在 SEC 审阅完成之后，需要修订 S-1 文件并进行路演，之后在 SEC 宣布生效和定价时才能交易。\n\n所以大概会在 11 月中下旬正式 IPO。 https://t.co/h9vYDKE3MI https://t.co/S6unObmZx3","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114716247531417771"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114712956571435277"],"id":"2114712956571435277","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":12626,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114710451884089845","type":"quoted"}],"text":"不是，这模型中间怎么有条黑线？\n\n这也能致敬苹果的铰链问题啊！ https://t.co/PdpTg6iwgQ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114712956571435277"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114710186313289729"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T13:27:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114710451884089845"],"id":"2114710451884089845","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":19340,"like_count":20,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2099456199557284012","type":"quoted"}],"text":"即览 1.0.2 版本已经正式适配了 iPhone DUO！\n\n同时还新增了记住上次观看位置的能力。\n\n让 Codex 做了一个展示的动画，没想到做得还挺好。\n\n找了半天都没有类似的 iPhone DUO样机，只好自己做一个了 https://t.co/9CijTtCknv https://t.co/jJ3pKxez4C","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114710451884089845"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T07:13:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114253911200841862"],"id":"2114253911200841862","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4143,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114253200056631752","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"原生组件库适配起来就是方便","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114253911200841862"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114253094439841792"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T07:10:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114253200056631752"],"id":"2114253200056631752","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":8741,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"即览即将完成 iPhone Duo 的适配！\n\n同时会新增记住上次阅读位置的能力 https://t.co/DfG0Tbxxqs","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114253200056631752"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114229066312376320"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T05:34:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114229075514651001"],"id":"2114229075514651001","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":16236,"like_count":31,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Notion 这个在 iPhone Duo 上的适配相当不错。\n\n我现在很多让 Grok bot 和 Muse 生成的内容 都会让它直接发到 Notion 里我去读。 https://t.co/71aP4j6od4","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114229075514651001"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114216596097073153"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T04:44:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114216604741550466"],"id":"2114216604741550466","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":12506,"like_count":46,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":3},"text":"Grokbot 的这个问题反馈机制也非常好。\n\n你跟他聊天时，一旦发现了 bug，并告诉他这可能是有问题的，他就会问你要不要反馈给团队。\n\n接着，他会直接帮你把日志和问题描述都发给 Grokbot 团队。\n\n这避免了用户自己反馈时写不清楚问题，也避免了用户为了少写内容而不反馈的情况 https://t.co/p6C4b2RWFB","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114216604741550466"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113989866023464960"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T13:44:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113989933564330298"],"id":"2113989933564330298","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":31453,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113639194484670628","type":"quoted"}],"text":"昨天说完，今天 WorkBuddy 就适配了 https://t.co/NTspkk7boF https://t.co/vVCVY4eODI","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113989933564330298"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T06:08:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113875132716568778"],"id":"2113875132716568778","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7844,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113874915430699223","type":"quoted"},{"id":"2113845519110078669","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"官宣了 https://t.co/LxIxf2gQYZ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113875132716568778"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T06:07:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113875002332512283"],"id":"2113875002332512283","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4563,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113844051938054167","type":"quoted"},{"id":"2113874915430699223","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"详情 https://t.co/kigrwr1RmZ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113875002332512283"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113874906425483264"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T06:07:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113874915430699223"],"id":"2113874915430699223","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":28396,"like_count":36,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113815343173116124","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Thariq 官宣从 Anthropic 离职了 https://t.co/U39MnEmrZU https://t.co/hRxXdPc6OE","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113874915430699223"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T04:10:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113845519110078669"],"id":"2113845519110078669","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":12894,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113815343173116124","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"记错了，Boris Cherny 才是作者，我老把他们两个搞混\n\nThariq 和 Boris 其实都是非常重要的人。早期 Thariq 发表了非常多关于 Skill、Agent SDK 和上下文的内容。\n\n不过他确实没有 Boris 职位大：Boris 是 Claude Code 整条产品线现在的负责人，他是普通的技术员工，主要影响力在于社区","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113845519110078669"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T02:10:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113815343173116124"],"id":"2113815343173116124","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":62,"impression_count":125904,"like_count":284,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":94,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113781170253308276","type":"quoted"}],"text":"有人爆料说，Claude Code 的作者 Thariq，离职了。\n\n他是一直以来代表 Anthropic 跟大家沟通的人，他在 Anthropic 的地位类似于 Tibo。这是一个非常重要的信号 https://t.co/9R2oRiLy9C","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113815343173116124"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2113638412372897793"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T14:30:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113639194484670628"],"id":"2113639194484670628","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":65438,"like_count":71,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":5},"text":"录个视频，让大家看看 AI 应用在 iPhone Duo上的识别情况。 https://t.co/magsp81kjO","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113639194484670628"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113559853998444544"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T09:15:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113559861581484129"],"id":"2113559861581484129","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6981,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"神奇， B 站也还行了 https://t.co/GDUXU6dD2E","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113559861581484129"},{"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:18:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113454985237364948"],"id":"2113454985237364948","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":84,"impression_count":27514,"like_count":110,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":62,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113276767582498943","type":"quoted"}],"text":"1 Password 的 Agent 连接器全量上线了\n\n可以直接授权像 muse 和 grokbot 这样的 Agent 登录对应的网页\n\n登录的时候，1 Password 会完成密码和账号的填写，所以 Agent 是不会看到密码的 https://t.co/cbvxzx3QvG","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113454985237364948"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113454429743796224"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:16:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113454437662670869"],"id":"2113454437662670869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":14405,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113393684209176718","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Grokbot 现在已经可以连接你的手机上的应用了，比如说日历、通讯录和位置。\n\n更重要的是，它可以连接你的苹果“家庭”，不知道能不能控制里面的设备，还是说只能读取信息\n\n手机打开设置，然后在连接应用里会有一个手机的选项 https://t.co/mjdb2fwjaE https://t.co/SxpFz5VUX0","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113454437662670869"},{"created_at":"2026-10-22T09:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113201193162072136"],"id":"2113201193162072136","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5202,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113193055922921619","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"顺便前几天看了王自如的 iPhone 18 Pro 的测评，只能说还是牛皮，就坐那里说一点都不无聊","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113201193162072136"},{"created_at":"2026-10-22T08:57:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113193055922921619"],"id":"2113193055922921619","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":32937,"like_count":52,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112940762291941794","type":"quoted"}],"text":"影视飓风都出海了。不过凭影视飓风这个视频质量，确实是吊打一众海外做数码测评的。\n\n但我觉着他们现在的视频没啥意思，看完以后只记得那些花里胡哨的转场和一些非常漂亮的样片\n\n就是把测评做的不像测评了，反倒是昨天看何同学的感觉不错 https://t.co/4X9oPqtJlK","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113193055922921619"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2114999848919568384","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114927881864499200","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_21147338703274